docs {
  ## Accept Order — Not the Buyer

  Tests that only the buyer can accept an order.
  Replace `ORDER_UUID` with an order where the caller is the seller (not buyer).

  Expected: 400 Bad Request — "Only the buyer can accept this order"
}
